0x___1 = Slave in 'INIT' state
0x___2 = Slave in 'PREOP' state
0x___3 = Slave in 'BOOT' state
0x___4 = Slave in 'SAFEOP' state
0x___8 = Slave in 'OP' state]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>suffix</Name><Type>EtherCATSuffix</Type><Comment><![CDATA[prefix code
0x001_ = Slave signals error
0x002_ = Invalid vendorId, productCode... read
0x004_ = Initialization error occurred
0x008_ = Slave disabled
0x010_ = Slave not present
0x020_ = Slave signals link error
0x040_ = Slave signals missing link
0x080_ = Slave signals unexpected link
0x100_ = Communication port A
0x200_ = Communication port B
0x400_ = Communication port C
0x800_ = Communication port D]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>16</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>isFault</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[TRUE if either state is not 8 and code exists]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>32</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>colour</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><Comment><![CDATA[colour state]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Tc2_EtherCAT">ST_EcCrcError</Name><BitSize>96</BitSize><SubItem><Name>portA</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>portB</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>32</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>portC</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name>typeEtherCATIndicator</Name><BitSize>992</BitSize><SubItem><Name>currentState</Name><Type>typeEtherCATState</Type><Comment><![CDATA[inside colour]]></Comment><BitSize>96</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>historicalState</Name><Type>typeEtherCATState</Type><Comment><![CDATA[outside colour]]></Comment><BitSize>96</BitSize><BitOffs>96</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>SlaveNumber</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[slave number 1-65535]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>192</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>isPresent</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[TRUE if node is present in config]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>208</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>ConfigData</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_EtherCAT">ST_EcSlaveConfigData</Type><Comment><![CDATA[extra diagnostics]]></Comment><BitSize>640</BitSize><BitOffs>224</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>crcCount</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_EtherCAT">ST_EcCrcError</Type><BitSize>96</BitSize><BitOffs>864</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>hmiNum</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[PLC ordering number]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>960</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataT